        			<p>20%</p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td colspan="5" style="vertical-align:top">
        			<p>Notes:</p>
        
        			<p>[1] Plan district or overlay zone standards may supersede these standards.</p>
        
        			<p>[2] Ground floor residential uses should be raised a minimum of two feet from average sidewalk grade.</p>
        
